<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian budget forecasts cautious - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian budget forecasts cautious - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday that economic projections in the government's 1997/98 budget were cautious.</p>
<p>&quot;I think these are pretty cautious predictions, actually,&quot; he told Melbourne radio station 3AW.</p>
</text>
